msgid "Android Studio"
msgstr "Android Studio"

msgid ""
"`Android Studio <https://developer.android.com/studio>`_ is a free IDE for "
"Android development made by `Google <https://about.google/>`_ and `JetBrains "
"<https://www.jetbrains.com/>`_. It's based on `IntelliJ IDEA <https://"
"www.jetbrains.com/idea/>`_ and has a feature-rich editor which supports Java "
"and C/C++. It can be used to work on Godot's core engine as well as the "
"Android platform codebase."
msgstr ""
"`Android Studio <https://developer.android.com/studio>`_ 是由 `Google "
"<https://about.google/>`_ 和 `JetBrains <https://www.jetbrains.com/>`_ 联合推"
"出的一款免费安卓开发集成开发环境（IDE）。它基于 `IntelliJ IDEA <https://"
"www.jetbrains.com/idea/>`_ 打造，拥有功能极其强大的编辑器，并且完美支持 Java "
"和 C/C++ 语言。你可以用它来开发 Godot 的核心引擎，也可以用来处理安卓平台的代"
"码库。"

msgid "Importing the project"
msgstr "导入项目"

msgid "From the Android Studio's welcome window select **Open**."
msgstr "在 Android Studio 的欢迎窗口中，点击 **打开（Open）** 。"

msgid "Android Studio's welcome window."
msgstr "Android Studio 的欢迎界面."

msgid ""
"Navigate to ``<Godot root directory>/platform/android/java`` and select the "
"``settings.gradle`` file."
msgstr ""
"导航到 ``<Godot root directory>/platform/android/java`` 目录，然后选中 "
"``settings.gradle`` 文件。"

msgid "Android Studio will import and index the project."
msgstr "Android Studio 将导入项目并为其编制索引."

msgid "Android Studio project layout"
msgstr "Android Studio 项目结构"

msgid ""
"The project is organized using `Android Studio's modules <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/projects#ApplicationModules>`_:"
msgstr ""
"你可以使用 `Android Studio 4.1或更高版本 <https://developer.android.com/"
"studio/>`__ 进行安装："

msgid "``lib`` module:"
msgstr "``lib`` 模块："

msgid ""
"Located under ``<Godot root directory>/platform/android/java/lib``, this is "
"a **library module** that organizes"
msgstr ""
"这是一个用于组织 位于 ``<Godot root directory>/platform/android/java/lib`` 目"
"录下 的 **库模块**"

msgid ""
"the Godot java and native code and make it available as a reusable "
"dependency / artifact."
msgstr ""
"（包含）Godot 的 Java 和原生代码，并将其作为可重复使用的依赖项或产物提供。"

msgid ""
"The artifact generated by this module is made available for other Android "
"modules / projects to use as a dependency, via `MavenCentral <https://"
"repo1.maven.org/maven2/org/godotengine/godot/>`_."
msgstr ""
"该模块生成的产物（artifact）会通过 `MavenCentral <https://repo1.maven.org/"
"maven2/org/godotengine/godot/>`_ 发布，以便其他的 Android 模块或项目将其作为"
"依赖项来使用。"

msgid "``editor`` module:"
msgstr "``editor`` 模块："

msgid ""
"Located under ``<Godot root directory>/platform/android/java/editor``, this "
"is an **application module** that holds"
msgstr ""
"位于 ``<Godot 根目录>/platform/android/java/editor`` 中，这就是一个\\ **应用"
"程序模块**\\ ，"

msgid "the source code for the Android port of the Godot Editor."
msgstr "存放的是 Godot Editor 的 Android 移植版的源代码。"

msgid "This module has a dependency on the ``lib`` module."
msgstr "这个模块依赖于 ``lib`` 模块。"

msgid "``app`` module:"
msgstr "``app`` 模块："

msgid ""
"Located under ``<Godot root directory>/platform/android/java/app``, this is "
"an **application module** that holds"
msgstr ""
"位于 ``<Godot 根目录>/platform/android/java/app`` 中，这就是一个\\ **应用程序"
"模块**\\ ，"

msgid "the source code for the Android build templates."
msgstr "存放的是 Android 构建模板的源代码。"

msgid "Building & debugging the editor module"
msgstr "编辑器模块的构建与调试"

msgid "To build the ``editor`` module:"
msgstr "要构建 ``editor`` 模块："

msgid ""
"Select the `Run/Debug Configurations drop down <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_ and select "
"``editor``."
msgstr ""
"点击 `运行/调试配置下拉菜单 <https://developer.android.com/studio/run/"
"rundebugconfig#running>`_ ，然后选择 ``editor`` 。"

msgid ""
"Select **Run > Run 'editor'** from the top menu or `click the Run icon "
"<https://developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_."
msgstr ""
"从顶部菜单选择 **Run > Run 'editor'** 或\\ `点击运行图标 <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_。"

msgid "To debug the ``editor`` module:"
msgstr "要调试 ``editor`` 模块："

msgid ""
"Open the **Build Variants** window using **View > Tools Windows > Build "
"Variants** from the top menu."
msgstr ""
"从顶部菜单栏选择 **查看 > 工具窗口 > 构建变体（View > Tools Windows > Build "
"Variants）** ，即可打开 **Build Variants（构建变体）** 窗口。"

msgid ""
"In the **Build Variants** window, make sure that in the **Active Build "
"Variant** column, the ``:editor`` entry is set to one of the **Dev** "
"variants."
msgstr ""
"在 **Build Variants（构建变体）** 窗口中，确保 **Active Build Variant（当前活"
"动构建变体）** 一栏里， ``:editor`` 对应的选项被设置为了某个 **Dev（开发）** "
"版本的变体。"

msgid ""
"Open the **Run/Debug Configurations** window by clicking on **Run > Edit "
"Configurations...** on the top menu."
msgstr ""
"点击顶部菜单栏的 **运行 > 编辑配置...（Run > Edit Configurations...）** ，即"
"可打开 **运行/调试配置（Run/Debug Configurations）** 窗口。"

msgid ""
"In the **Run/Debug Configurations** window, select the ``editor`` entry, and "
"under **Debugger** make sure the **Debug Type** is set to ``Dual (Java + "
"Native)``"
msgstr ""
"在 **运行/调试配置** 窗口中，选择 ``editor`` 条目，并在 **调试器** 下确保 **"
"调试类型** 设置为 ``Dual (Java + Native)``"

msgid ""
"Click the ``+`` sign under the **Symbol Directories** section, and add the "
"``lib`` module directory: ``platform/android/java/lib``"
msgstr ""
"在 **Symbol Directories（符号目录）** 部分，点击 ``+`` 号，然后添加 ``lib`` "
"模块的目录：``platform/android/java/lib``"

msgid ""
"Select **Run > Debug 'editor'** from the top menu or `click the Debug icon "
"<https://developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_."
msgstr ""
"从顶部菜单选择 **Run > Debug 'editor'** 或\\ `点击调试图标 <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_。"

msgid "Building & debugging the app module"
msgstr "应用模块的构建与调试"

msgid ""
"The ``app`` module requires the presence of a Godot project in its "
"``assets`` directory (``<Godot root directory>/platform/android/java/app/src/"
"main/assets``) to run. This is usually handled by the Godot Editor during "
"the export process. While developing in Android Studio, it's necessary to "
"manually add a Godot project under that directory to replicate the export "
"process. Once that's done, you can follow the instructions below to run/"
"debug the ``app`` module:"
msgstr ""
"``app`` 模块要想正常运行，必须在它的 ``assets`` 目录下（即 ``<Godot root "
"directory>/platform/android/java/app/src/main/assets`` ）包含一个 Godot 项"
"目。通常情况下，这一步是由 Godot 编辑器在导出项目时自动完成的。但在 Android "
"Studio 中进行开发时，为了模拟这个导出过程，你需要手动在这个目录下放入一个 "
"Godot 项目。完成这一步后，你就可以按照下面的说明来运行或调试 ``app`` 模块了："

msgid "To build the ``app`` module:"
msgstr "要构建 ``app`` 模块："

msgid ""
"Select the `Run/Debug Configurations drop down <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_ and select "
"``app``."
msgstr ""
"点击 `运行/调试配置下拉菜单 <https://developer.android.com/studio/run/"
"rundebugconfig#running>`_ ，然后选择 ``app`` 。"

msgid ""
"Select **Run > Run 'app'** from the top menu or `click the Run icon <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_."
msgstr ""
"从顶部菜单栏选择 **运行 > 运行 'app'（Run > Run 'app'）** ，或者 `点击运行图"
"标 <https://developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_。"

msgid "To debug the ``app`` module:"
msgstr "要调试 ``app`` 模块："

msgid ""
"In the **Build Variants** window, make sure that in the **Active Build "
"Variant** column, the ``:app`` entry is set to one of the **Dev** variants."
msgstr ""
"在 **Build Variants（构建变体）** 窗口中，确保 **Active Build Variant（当前活"
"动构建变体）** 一栏里， ``:app`` 对应的选项被设置为了某个 **Dev（开发）** 版"
"本的变体。"

msgid ""
"In the **Run/Debug Configurations** window, select the ``app`` entry, and "
"under **Debugger** make sure the **Debug Type** is set to ``Dual (Java + "
"Native)``"
msgstr ""
"在 **运行/调试配置** 窗口中，选择 ``app`` 条目，然后在 **调试器** 下确保 **调"
"试类型** 设置为 ``Dual (Java + Native)``"

msgid ""
"Select **Run > Debug 'app'** from the top menu or `click the Debug icon "
"<https://developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_."
msgstr ""
"从顶部菜单栏选择 **运行 > 调试 'app'（Run > Debug 'app'）** ，或者 `点击调试"
"图标 <https://developer.android.com/studio/run/rundebugconfig#running>`_。"

msgid ""
"If you run into any issues, ask for help in `Godot's Android dev channel "
"<https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/android>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果你遇到了任何问题，可以去 `Godot's Android dev channel <https://"
"chat.godotengine.org/channel/android>`__ 寻求帮助。"
